---
import { travel, paket } from '../data/trip';
---
<footer class="on-dark bg-[#0B3C5D] text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl grid-cols-1 gap-10 px-4 py-14 md:grid-cols-12 md:px-6">
    <div class="md:col-span-5">
      <p class="font-display text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight">{travel.nama}</p>
      <p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{travel.tagline}.</p>
      <p class="mt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/85">{travel.alamat}</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-white/75">{travel.jam}</p>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-4">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF8A4C]">Paket</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 divide-y divide-white/10 text-sm">
        {paket.map((p) => (
          <li class="py-2"><a href={`/paket/#${p.slug}`} class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#FF8A4C]">{p.nama}</a></li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="md:col-span-3">
      <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF8A4C]">Hubungi</p>
      <ul class="mt-3 space-y-1.5 text-sm">
        <li><a href={`https://wa.me/${travel.telepon}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#FF8A4C]">WhatsApp {travel.telepon}</a></li>
        <li><a href="/info/" class="transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-[#FF8A4C]">Syarat & pembatalan</a></li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-5 text-xs leading-relaxed text-white/55">{travel.dp}.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="border-t border-white/10 px-4 py-5 text-xs text-white/50 md:px-6">
    <div class="mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-1 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between">
      <span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} {travel.nama}, {travel.kota}</span>
      <span>Jadwal dapat berubah mengikuti cuaca dan keputusan otoritas setempat.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
